.in. Martin Scorsese, Manolo Blahnik i Christian Louboutin.","popularity":2.0322,"poster_path":"/hnX54hxajalmK2p0UrcEdFNX4TV.jpg","release_date":"2021-10-11","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.4,"vote_count":7,"character":"Self","credit_id":"5f202688d9f4a6003525e24b","order":6},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/k8mlLJo078teSilppPlRhkOWP3D.jpg","genre_ids":[99],"id":135545,"title":"A Conversation with Gregory Peck","original_language":"en","original_title":"A Conversation with Gregory Peck","overview":"","popularity":0.9591,"poster_path":"/xCLgzI14ZEHzm2eSghSLrvnDwod.jpg","release_date":"1999-10-14","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.594,"vote_count":16,"character":"Self","credit_id":"5f5411a846f35400351a6583","order":10},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/mpbA9rafSetOx07wRP6AXu24c67.jpg","genre_ids":[99],"id":711439,"title":"Martin Scorsese's Quarantine Short Film","original_language":"en","original_title":"Martin Scorsese's Quarantine Short Film","overview":"","popularity":0.6808,"poster_path":"/5fYlID0FNC3mGo0uMlI9E6lPxZ0.jpg","release_date":"2020-05-28","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.2,"vote_count":7,"character":"Self","credit_id":"5f5bb34d629b2c0035c3edb1","order":0},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/hhCp6ZLDjS5wUHkGg7k3VGvH3Xm.jpg","genre_ids":[18],"id":11873,"title":"Kolor Pieniędzy","original_language":"en","original_title":"The Color of Money","overview":"Eddie \"Fast\" Felson, stary i doświadczony bilardzista, który już dawno wycofał się z branży, pewnego dnia spotyka godnego siebie ucznia, młodego i zdolnego Vincenta. Mężczyźni wyjeżdżają na tournee po knajpach, gdzie Eddie uczy Vincenta wszystkich znanych sobie sztuczek. Jednak po pewnym czasie między mistrzem i uczniem dochodzi do konfliktu, który doprowadza do tego, że na turnieju w Atlantic City stają przeciwko sobie.","popularity":4.0433,"poster_path":"/f9dh3Dq1LS0DEKnrnz9B3u3n4r9.jpg","release_date":"1986-10-17","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.85